    Lemma recycle_sec_arepq_at :
      (forall msF' mo', rs_gpost msF' mo' -> sreach asegs Q (mkCfg msF' mo')) -> sreach asegs Q (mkCfg msF mo).
    Proof.
      (* Process-model revision repair.  The recorded KReplay body no longer type-checked: it was
         recorded against [rs_model]'s old vm_maps conjunct (map_remove), which
         As/AS_SecRecycle2.v:64 now states as [maps_subtract], and the replay blob cannot be
         decoded or re-encoded.  It is replaced by the text proof of the same lemma in the same
         Section (RSStep, At) of projects/openssl/echconfiglist_parser/proofs/lib/As/AG_RecycleSec.v.
         That Section's context and the statements this proof applies ([recycle_sec_sreach],
         [recycle_sec_post], [rs_model], [rstep_post], [amodelx_after_rs], the *_after_rs lemmas,
         the ak_* lemmas, [large_cells_of_arepq], [senv_of_arepq], [renv_of_arepqx]) have the same
         shape and argument order in this tree.  Literals substituted, each read off this tree:
           VISE pc (hVISE)  0x19e2ec -> 0x51100   (this file:98; As/AS_SecRecycle.v:69)
           hTPR floor       11899400 -> 6337480   (As/AS_SecRecycle.v:37, TPR)
           hRNG floor       11899312 -> 6337392   (As/AS_SecRecycle.v:38, RNG)
           AINST            6765656  -> 1203736   (As/AllocRep.v:29, 0x125e18)
